        "slc_d71440aaad0ea552b545f625cd42579462df2cd48a24d3deeadcaed401bdbae8"
      ],
      "text": "The product is a long-lived local daemon plus thin clients (hooks, CLI, MCP, SDK); the daemon is the sole process talking to storage, reached over loopback HTTP on 127.0.0.1:3850."
    },
