        "slc_a59d6460afb8476e8b0621575d4e8dd5bd2ad89d10dcaf60a8629f5f1defae8f"
      ],
      "text": "Memories exist at three tiers: a one-line key, a distilled summary carrying the semantic embedding, and the full raw session dialogue; resolution is a deterministic pointer walk across three Deeplake tables."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ddf6cb96e3ce82a516ff68742ab020fb12e34502691ab1ada66df2a5cfafcbfb",
