          "url": "https://github.com/legioncodeinc/honeycomb/blob/c1cb6bf5674ca169728e79433bf035e0d3d1483c/README.md#L91-L97"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8b6938283f2b4cec7e307883ecaa245a3a7115f9a36fee93f73fb4296c2d3dfc"
      ],
      "text": "At session start a bounded index of roughly 300-800 tokens of relevant keys is pushed once, with deeper detail pulled on demand rather than injected per turn."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9a3b259b09a109931c694e197051a1682108e1f4395050d7002c38e3d9436efe",
