          "url": "https://github.com/legioncodeinc/honeycomb/blob/c1cb6bf5674ca169728e79433bf035e0d3d1483c/README.md#L290-L293"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7e694baa69cda9669ca2535cef51502b329b96a77efa08c80cdd2e56f6229a96"
      ],
      "text": "The daemon binds loopback only (single machine); cross-device and cross-user sharing happen through Deeplake's org/workspace scope rather than a remote daemon bind."
    },
