      ],
      "text": "A unified honeycomb CLI exposes verbs such as setup, status, login, start/stop, remember, recall, sessions, and uninstall; baseline operational verbs accept --json with exit codes 2/1/0 for malformed usage, runtime failure, and success."
    },
