        "slc_fff575bcde06dc898ccc9ddfa0e7477b2cb3455cdce4b87fa154dc9eb105ebdd"
      ],
      "text": "Honeycomb is built on Activeloop Deeplake (extending the open-source Hivemind agent-memory project), using BM25 lexical plus 768-dim nomic-embed-text-v1.5 semantic search fused by Reciprocal Rank Fusion."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8bd600f44841d38325e762b3cfa68912a8e8c05c7a2ad198ece46daf02b4352f",
