        "slc_dd0d3f82144fe563c893a6113e5ee837805cf72f1b90e4716292451b8aaa3996"
      ],
      "text": "Storage can be self-hosted against Activeloop's pg_deeplake Postgres extension, pointed at via honeycomb login --endpoint with a postgres:// or https:// URL, without an Activeloop account."
    },
