      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7e694baa69cda9669ca2535cef51502b329b96a77efa08c80cdd2e56f6229a96"
      ],
      "text": "Embeddings are opt-in: recall defaults to lexical BM25, and enabling the local embedding runtime (~600 MB fetched on first warmup) adds semantic recall; recall silently falls back and never errors when embeddings are unavailable."
    },
